# .env is committed deliberately. This repository is private and the team needs
# the backend to come up in live mode without per-machine setup. It is already
# tracked, so listing it here would only be confusing — the entry is left out on
# purpose. Rotate the key when the unit ends, and remember that git history keeps
# it even after a delete.
